<description>&lt;p&gt;An illegal gold mine in southwestern Colombia collapsed, killing 14 miners and injuring 7. A Black Hawk helicopter crash left thirteen Colombian soldiers stranded in Cauca. President De la Espriella has launched a total offensive against ELN and dissident FARC forces in Arauca. Ecuador arrested four FARC dissident leaders on the border, linking them to the Colombian crisis, and the conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOMTJ3c2hrVXpaUkVyaWxndmgzWHNmckRrN1ZqckV5cExTV3ZSTTA4NGE1bTc1bDRZX1RISFRUNjA1S1JRM2NoTDBoLXBCSmxEZE9lTWI5TVNzSFJRUFNXRm1sWERnNFJsSVZud1R1VHBXUTlWM01aR3kyTnhIdEJZT0k0SjYzSDRiMHB4UVNQUmFncVI4clgtc3VhX1lwRjdfT2pRSkRNY0luT2oxT0FsV3FUR2p1aWprQWxKc2xGaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The City Paper Bogotá&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNWDJYODJHdEJETVdpMXc5eENPdmN2UFFCOTJjME1uaXkydkxTNGR1SEloM2VpWlZKcDIyYkhGcVU2M3NRdWd5Nk04bkpKZjRGZG1WbHhVZExYbldkVlA1eWNsR3p5dVFQRG1rU2FrcWNYVDdrMkg3eVRTMzl6c19fTlZrU1NxWW1MZ1FzTzJJQzRoTnNFaTJMLW8wTmc1bFl1V3NVbC1YLS1aZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;News of Bahrain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSEVmUzJSWmJtcWF4VW9VenRTNEVTbUR5ay1XbXNXeWtfRGw5c0hPRnYwY0FQYnEwSlNhLVNqdUxMUU53QUl2S1NmN01CRGlNRHFKelF4LW5iMWs3SHVJZ0RMbkJuS3JMbE9zQUIzYnpSZWpSRGViRjVPMEdCR0otODVBaWhodURnc0UwbWVBM0Z3QkwyWHQtSDE5dmZETUVKaVI4Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ratopati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOU2JPSjVkN0R5dmRBQWN1Q0kzSTJlNm4yaVROVk93UjYwWWdSVG9MWU54dHd2MVdubkFSMGhhV2J5ZWFFNUlJTy1vUnNHZnJaMGtJWjFYWnBBRldSZkppWHR2WFBzTWIxQk1uSGZjMnZjX3QwalBqOHdReTMxTWs2dF9ScHVKUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haberler.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://